<treenode node="addStringAttachment;PHP:Function Name;D:\www\imagecity\email\src\PHPMailer.php;f11;3220;5;3242;;;;vpos;;v;;r Definition     addStringAttachment(         $string,         $filename,         $encoding = &apos;base64&apos;,         $type = &apos;&apos;,         $disposition = &apos;attachment&apos;     )  Description      Add a string or binary attachment (non-filesystem). This method can be used to attach ascii or binary data, such as a BLOB record from a database.  Parameters:     string $string - String attachment data     string $filename - Name of the attachment     string $encoding - File encoding (see $Encoding)     string $type - File extension (MIME) type     string $disposition - Disposition to use;;d6,3226;;b1,0;;mstring $string;;pstring $filename;;pstring $encoding;;pstring $type;;pstring $disposition;;p">
