</treenode>
<treenode node="hmac;PHP:Function Name;D:\www\imagecity\email\src\SMTP.php;f14;553;5;578;;;;vpos;;vstring;;r Definition     hmac($data, $key)  Description      Calculate an MD5 HMAC hash. Works like hash_hmac(&apos;md5&apos;, $data, $key) in case that function is not available.  Parameters:     string $data - The data to hash     string $key - The key to hash with;;d4,554;;b2,0;;mstring $data;;pstring $key;;p">
</treenode>
<treenode node="mail;PHP:Function Name;D:\www\imagecity\email\src\SMTP.php;f11;814;5;823;;;;vpos;;vbool;;r Definition     mail($from)  Description      Send an SMTP MAIL command. Starts a mail transaction from the email address specified in $from. Returns true if successful or false otherwise. If True the mail transaction is started and then one or more recipient commands may be called followed by a data command. Implements RFC 821: MAIL &lt;SP&gt; FROM:&lt;reverse-path&gt; &lt;CRLF&gt;.  Parameters:     string $from - Source address of this message;;d4,815;;b1,0;;mstring $from;;p">
</treenode>
