</treenode>
<treenode node="quit;PHP:Function Name;D:\www\imagecity\email\src\SMTP.php;f11;834;5;844;;;;vpos;;vbool;;r Definition     quit($close_on_error = true)  Description      Send an SMTP QUIT command. Closes the socket if there is no error or the $close_on_error argument is true. Implements from RFC 821: QUIT &lt;CRLF&gt;.  Parameters:     bool $close_on_error - Should the connection close if an error occurs?;;d4,835;;b1,0;;mbool $close_on_error;;p">
</treenode>
<treenode node="recipient;PHP:Function Name;D:\www\imagecity\email\src\SMTP.php;f11;856;5;863;;;;vpos;;vbool;;r Definition     recipient($address)  Description      Send an SMTP RCPT command. Sets the TO argument to $toaddr. Returns true if the recipient was accepted false if it was rejected. Implements from RFC 821: RCPT &lt;SP&gt; TO:&lt;forward-path&gt; &lt;CRLF&gt;.  Parameters:     string $address - The address the message is being sent to;;d4,857;;b1,0;;mstring $address;;p">
</treenode>
<treenode node="recordLastTransactionID;PHP:Function Name;D:\www\imagecity\email\src\SMTP.php;f14;1283;5;1300;;;;vpos;;vbool;;r Definition     recordLastTransactionID()  Description      Extract and return the ID of the last SMTP transaction based on a list of patterns provided in SMTP::$smtp_transaction_id_patterns. Relies on the host providing the ID in response to a DATA command. If no reply has been received yet, it will return null. If no pattern was matched, it will return false.  Return:    |null|string;;d4,1284;;b2,0;;m">
