</treenode>
<treenode node="sendAndMail;PHP:Function Name;D:\www\imagecity\email\src\SMTP.php;f11;957;5;960;;;;vpos;;vbool;;r Definition     sendAndMail($from)  Description      Send an SMTP SAML command. Starts a mail transaction from the email address specified in $from. Returns true if successful or false otherwise. If True the mail transaction is started and then one or more recipient commands may be called followed by a data command. This command will send the message to the users terminal if they are logged in and send them an email. Implements RFC 821: SAML &lt;SP&gt; FROM:&lt;reverse-path&gt; &lt;CRLF&gt;.  Parameters:     string $from - The address the message is from;;d4,958;;b1,0;;mstring $from;;p">
